{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.BringTrefoilCinquefoilChannel","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.BringTrefoilCinquefoilChannel","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Complex.Circle","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.RootsOfUnity.Complex"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.quintic_gauss_sum_sq_eq_five","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.quintic_gauss_sum_sq_eq_five","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/bring-trefoil-cinquefoil-channel.lean#L79-L114","doc":"**The quintic √5 — `g² = 5` (proved).** The quadratic Gauss sum over the\ncinquefoil's `ℤ₅`-orbit, `g = Σ_{k=0}^{4} ζ₅^{k²}` (written out as the five\npowers `0,1,4,9,16`), squares to `5`. This is the unique source of `ζ₅`'s\nirrationality over `ℚ` and the √5 the H₂S Bring constant `1/√5` is built\nfrom; the first Lagrange resolvent `w₁` of `ℤ₅ ⊂ S₅` carries it.\n\nProof: `ζ₅` is a primitive 5th root (`Complex.isPrimitiveRoot_exp`), so\n`1 + ζ₅ + ζ₅² + ζ₅³ + ζ₅⁴ = 0` (`geom_sum_eq_zero`) and `ζ₅⁵ = 1`. Reducing\n`ζ₅⁹ = ζ₅⁴`, `ζ₅¹⁶ = ζ₅` gives `g = 1 + 2ζ₅ + 2ζ₅⁴`, and\n`g² − 5 = (4ζ₅³+8)(ζ₅⁵−1) + 4(1+ζ₅+ζ₅²+ζ₅³+ζ₅⁴)` — a polynomial identity\nclosed by `linear_combination`. The archimedean root `g = +√5`\n(`p = 5 ≡ 1 mod 4`) is the sign refinement; `g² = 5` is the field-theoretic\ncore that fixes the irrational scale. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.zeta5_pow_five","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.zeta5_pow_five","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/bring-trefoil-cinquefoil-channel.lean#L66-L77","doc":"`ζ₅⁵ = 1` — the 5-fold (cinquefoil / `ℤ₅ ⊂ S₅`) symmetry around which the\nchiral residue's monodromy is taken. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.zeta5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.zeta5","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/bring-trefoil-cinquefoil-channel.lean#L61-L64","doc":"Primitive fifth root of unity `ζ₅ = exp(2πi/5)` (local copy, matching\n`x5-z5-automorphism.lean`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.bring_trefoil_cinquefoil_channel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.bring_trefoil_cinquefoil_channel","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/bring-trefoil-cinquefoil-channel.lean#L47-L59","doc":"**The trefoil + cinquefoil channel** (the provable scaffold).\n\nThe chiral channel is the trefoil `T_{2,3}` (Seifert genus 1) and the `ζ₅`\ncarrier is the cinquefoil `T_{2,5}` (Seifert genus 2); both embed in Bring's\n`Σ₄` (genus ≤ 4) and they are **distinct** torus knots. This is the discrete\ncontent the audit doc records — two torus knots in one `Σ₄`, not one fibre\nwith two symmetries. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:bring-trefoil-cinquefoil-channel","label":"prop:bring-trefoil-cinquefoil-channel","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/bring-trefoil-cinquefoil-channel.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.torusKnotGenus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.torusKnotGenus","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/bring-trefoil-cinquefoil-channel.lean#L44-L45","doc":"Seifert genus of the torus knot `T_{m,n}`: `g = (m-1)(n-1)/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.bringsGenus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringChiralCinquefoil.bringsGenus","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/bring-trefoil-cinquefoil-channel.lean#L41-L42","doc":"Genus of Bring's genus-4 Seifert fibre `Σ₄`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}